1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
我們把公館汀州路三段，打造成數位孿生場景。
We recreated Section 3 of Tingzhou Road in Gongguan as a digital twin.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,000
用來產生訓練影像，並測試自動避閃。
It supplies training images and a testbed for automatic avoidance.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
突然切入的車，可能讓騎士來不及反應。
A sudden cut-in may leave too little time for a rider to react.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
沒開避閃時，碰撞會把騎士撞飛。
With avoidance off, this collision throws the rider off.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
濃霧中，停在路中間的車，可能要靠近才看得清楚。
In dense fog, a car stopped in the lane may only become visible up close.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
在這個場景裡，我們先用 Raycast 模擬距離感測。
In this environment, we first use raycasts to simulate distance sensing.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
這些射線會偵測障礙物，幫助系統減速和繞開。
These rays detect obstacles and help the controller slow down and steer around them.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
遇到機車從巷口橫越，
When another scooter crosses from a side street,

9
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,000
系統就先煞車，讓對方通過，再回到巡航。
the system brakes, lets it pass, and resumes cruising.

10
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,500
現在，我們也訓練了第一版視覺模型。
We have now trained our first vision model.

11
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:47,000
畫面上的框，是模型實際辨識出的汽車和機車。
These boxes are actual car and motorcycle detections from the model.

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:52,000
辨識結果會和 Raycast 的距離、移動資訊配對。
The detections are matched with distance and motion from raycasts.

13
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
再由既有的規則控制器，決定煞車或避讓。
Our rule-based controller then decides when to brake or steer.

14
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
視覺結果不確定時，仍保留 Raycast 的避閃。
When visual evidence is uncertain, Raycast avoidance remains available.

15
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,000
只看影像框，路邊的車也可能被判成威脅。
An image-box warning rule can flag a roadside car as a threat.

16
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,000
左邊因此煞車，右邊則結合 Raycast 確認路徑。
The left run brakes; the right uses raycast geometry to check the path.

17
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,000
確認前方能通過，就繼續行駛，減少不必要的反應。
With a clear path, it keeps moving and avoids the unnecessary response.

18
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:17,000
下一步，我們會把模型部署到 UGen300，
Next, we plan to deploy the model on UGen300,

19
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:21,000
實際量測延遲、耗電，還有量化後的辨識表現。
and measure latency, power use, and detection quality after quantization.

20
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:27,000
再加入更多道路和真實影像，驗證不同路況下的效果。
We will add more roads and real camera data to evaluate a wider range of conditions.
